vices Operating in Unlicensed Bands', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #ETSI--KEYSIGHT DELIVERS REGULATORY TEST SOLUTION TO ACCELERATE CERTIFICATION OF WIRELESS DEVICES OPERATING IN UNLICENSED BANDS'}{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-05-25 09:04:00-04:56', 'title': 'New Study by U by Kotex® Shows 35% Increase in Period Poverty Since 2018', 'text': "NEENAH, WIS., MAY 24, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN A NEW STUDY CONDUCTED BY U BY KOTEX ®, RESEARCH SHOWS THAT TWO IN FIVE PEOPLE HAVE STRUGGLED TO PURCHASE PERIOD PRODUCTS1, A 35% INCREASE FROM THE BRAND'S INITIAL RESEARCH IN 2018."}{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2021-05-25 10:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Heinz Is Searching for Its First-Ever ‘Head Burger Artist'", 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FEW THINGS ARE MORE MAGICAL THAN BURGER NIGHT AND THE ART OF CRAFTING THE PERFECT BURGER. EVERY BURGER IS A BLANK CANVAS, WHICH MAKES HEINZ CONDIMENTS THE PAINT TO CREATE A BURGER MASTERPIECE. THAT'S WHY THIS SUMMER, HEINZ IS HONORING THE BEST IN BURGER ARTISTRY BY SEARCHING FOR ITS FIRST-EVER “HEINZ HEAD BURGER ARTIST.” THE CONDIMENT CONNOISSEUR THAT BEST CAPTURES THE ART OF THE BURGER WILL WIN $25,000 AND SOME SAUCY PERKS, LIKE: TASTE-TESTING AMERICA'S B"}{'symbol': 'LH', 'date': '2021-05-25 17:14:00-04:56', 'title': 'Labcorp Study Suggests COVID-19 Antibodies Remain at Least 10 Months After Infection', 'text': "BURLINGTON, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NEARLY 87% OF NATURALLY INFECTED COVID-19 PATIENTS MAINTAINED ANTIBODIES TO SARS-COV-2 PROTEINS FOR AT LEAST 10 MONTHS, ACCORDING TO A NEW LABCORP (NYSE: LH) ANALYSIS OF SPECIMENS FROM 39,086 INDIVIDUALS. THE STUDY, PUBLISHED MAY 24 IN THE LANCET-AFFILIATED ECLINICALMEDICINE, OFFERS REAL-WORLD EVIDENCE OF THE BODY'S RESPONSE TO THE VIRUS AND THE POSSIBILITY OF PROTECTION AGAINST FUTURE INFECTION. IT IS THE LARGEST KNOWN COVID-19-RELATED STUDY BY SPECIMEN VOLUM"}{'symbol': 'LW', 'date': '2021-05-25 17:35:00-04:56', 'title': 'Lamb Weston Announces Chief Financial Officer Succession', 'text': 'EAGLE, IDAHO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ROBERT MCNUTT, SVP AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, TO RETIRE AUG. 6. BERNADETTE MADARIETA, VICE PRESIDENT AND CONTROLLER, TO SUCCEED HIM IN THE ROLE.'}{'symbol': 'LKQ', 'date': '2021-05-25 10:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'LKQ Corporation Acquires Green Bean Battery', 'text': "CHICAGO, MAY 25, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- LKQ CORPORATION (NASDAQ: LKQ), A LEADING PROVIDER OF ALTERNATIVE AND SPECIALTY PARTS TO REPAIR AND ACCESSORIZE AUTOMOBILES AND OTHER VEHICLES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ACQUIRED THE BUSINESS AND ASSETS OF GREEN BEAN BATTERY, LLC (“GREEN BEAN”). FOUNDED IN 2016, GREEN BEAN IS A HYBRID BATTERY RECONDITIONER AND INSTALLER, WHICH HAS DEVELOPED A PROPRIETARY HYBRID BATTERY RECONDITIONING PROCESS THAT CREATES A MORE RELIABLE BATTERY WHILE SIMULTANEOUSLY EXTENDING ITS USEFUL LIFE. GREEN BEAN ACQUIRES HYBRID BATTERY CORES FROM MULTIPLE SOURCES, INCLUDING LKQ, AND RECONDITIONS THEM AT ITS STATE-OF-THE-ART FACILITIES ACROSS EIGHT TRADING ZONES LOCATED THROUGHOUT THE UNITED STATES. AS A FULL-SERVICE PROVIDER, GREEN BEAN INSTALLS ITS RECONDITIONED BATTERIES AT ITS CUSTOMERS' PREFERRED LOCATIONS IN EACH OF THESE TRADING ZONES WHERE LKQ OPERATES TODAY. GREEN BEAN CURRENTLY RECONDITIONS BATTERIES FOR HYBRID VEHICLES MANUFACTURED BY TOYOTA, HONDA, GENERAL MOTORS, LEXUS, AND NISSAN."}{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2021-05-25 16:51:00-04:56', 'title': 'St. Regis Hotels & Resorts Heralds A New Beacon Of Beachfront Glamour With The Debut Of The St. Regis Bermuda Resort', 'text': "ST. GEORGE'S,\xa0BERMUDA, MAY 24, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ST. REGIS HOTELS & RESORTS\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF THE ST. REGIS BERMUDA RESORT.\xa0EXTENDING THE LEGACY OF ST. REGIS FROM NEW YORK'S FINEST ADDRESS OF 55TH AND FIFTH, THE RESORT BLENDS THE TIMELESSNESS OF A BYGONE ERA WITH AVANT-GARDE BERMUDIAN DESIGN AND CULTURAL INFLUENCES."}{'symbol': 'MLM', 'date': '2021-05-25 02:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Martin Marietta Announces Acquisition\xa0o